@charset "utf-8";
/*======================================
 [ -Main Stylesheet-
  Theme: Zonar
  Version: 1.0
  Last change: 30/08/2020 ]
++ Fonts ++
++ General Style ++
++ Loader ++
++ Cursor ++
++ Typography ++
++ Main ++
